{"mode":"words","text":"Nu luister je naar de tekst en lees je tegelijkertijd mee. Als beginner lees je de betekenisregel in je moedertaal, luister je langzaam naar de doeltaal en druk je vaak op pauze — zo koppelt je brein de klank aan de betekenis. Als gevorderde lees je de originele tekst en kijk je alleen even naar beneden bij onbekende woorden. Maak daarbij vaak gebruik van de A-B-herhaling: selecteer een enkele zin en laat deze in een lus afspelen — probeer het hierboven eens uit.","words":[{"s":0,"e":221},{"s":290,"e":615},{"s":650,"e":708},{"s":755,"e":859},{"s":894,"e":952},{"s":1033,"e":1451},{"s":1567,"e":1765},{"s":1846,"e":2043},{"s":2101,"e":2159},{"s":2206,"e":2902},{"s":2961,"e":3355},{"s":3738,"e":3866},{"s":3924,"e":4365},{"s":4458,"e":4644},{"s":4679,"e":4725},{"s":4772,"e":4818},{"s":4865,"e":5747},{"s":5782,"e":5840},{"s":5886,"e":5933},{"s":5979,"e":6734},{"s":7117,"e":7477},{"s":7523,"e":7581},{"s":7674,"e":8069},{"s":8115,"e":8220},{"s":8255,"e":8313},{"s":8371,"e":8952},{"s":9277,"e":9428},{"s":9474,"e":9695},{"s":9753,"e":9799},{"s":9857,"e":10054},{"s":10113,"e":10171},{"s":10217,"e":10716},{"s":10832,"e":10890},{"s":11099,"e":11239},{"s":11308,"e":11622},{"s":11680,"e":11726},{"s":11773,"e":12156},{"s":12307,"e":12400},{"s":12446,"e":12713},{"s":12771,"e":12864},{"s":12899,"e":12957},{"s":12992,"e":13932},{"s":14536,"e":14675},{"s":14722,"e":15209},{"s":15267,"e":15465},{"s":15523,"e":15569},{"s":15604,"e":15651},{"s":15709,"e":16231},{"s":16301,"e":16695},{"s":17020,"e":17171},{"s":17229,"e":17415},{"s":17462,"e":17508},{"s":17566,"e":17868},{"s":17961,"e":18286},{"s":18309,"e":18414},{"s":18449,"e":18959},{"s":19110,"e":19238},{"s":19308,"e":19830},{"s":19877,"e":20457},{"s":21061,"e":21258},{"s":21316,"e":21641},{"s":21723,"e":21908},{"s":21955,"e":22315},{"s":22373,"e":22477},{"s":22512,"e":22570},{"s":22640,"e":23673},{"s":24114,"e":24637},{"s":24695,"e":24764},{"s":24834,"e":25136},{"s":25182,"e":25461},{"s":25786,"e":25925},{"s":25